cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: PeacoQC Flow Cytometry QC
abstract: Removes acquisition anomalies (clogs, bubbles, drift in flow rate or signal) from each FCS file
  with PeacoQC. Writes the cleaned files with a per-sample QC table and PeacoQC's overview plot per file.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-peacoqc
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- cytometry
- flow-cytometry
- fcs
- quality-control
- peacoqc
- immunology
